# Edge Function secrets. Copy to supabase/functions/.env (gitignored) for
# `supabase functions serve`; set in production with `supabase secrets set`.
# A provider is registered only if its key is present (docs/spec.md §6.4).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Model for ingredient categorization (provider:model). `mock` uses a deterministic
# fake with no key and no cost; tests always use the mock.
# AI_MODEL_CATEGORIZE=anthropic:claude-haiku-5-5
